[Tips.ドカベン]
effect.name=A Dokaben-style rising and falling animation.
PI=- `speed`: Playback speed (%, 0 freezes the animation)\n- `auto_fall`: Auto fall (true / false)\n- `upright`: Upright duration (non-negative frame count, affected by playback speed)\n- `y_offset`: Y offset\n- `drop_frame`: Frame dropping (true / false)\n- `divisions_override`: Horizontal subdivisions (integer, at least 1; defaults to 1–32 based on width)\n
